206TL c  1975TuZW,1976TuZY: {+210}Bi isomer produced by {+209}Bi(n,|g) reaction 
206TL2c  with chemical and isotope separations. Half-life measurement included  
206TL3c  isotopic assay and grid chamber. Measured: |a, |g and ce singles,      
206TL4c  and |g|g and |a-|g coincidences with Si and Ge detectors.              
206TL c  1969La18: {+210}Bi isomer produced by {+209}Bi(n,|g) reaction          
206TL2c  with, and without, isotope separation and by chemical extraction of    
206TL3c  {+210}Pb from the source. Measured: |g singles and |g|g                
206TL4c  coincidences with Ge, Si(Li), and NaI detectors, and |a singles        
206TL5c  and |a-|g coincidences with Ge and Si surface-barrier detectors        
206TL c  Others:                                                                
206TL c  1961Ru02: {+210}Bi isomer produced by {+209}Bi(n,|g) reaction with     
206TL2c  chemical and isotope separation. Measured |a's with ionization chamber 
206TL3c  with resolving power of 28 keV, |g with NaI, ce with magnetic          
206TL4c  spectrometer, lifetimes from |g-|a coincidences with plastic           
206TL5c  detectors, and ce-|a coincidences in the magnetic spectrometer.        
206TL6c  Early work by the same authors: 1958Go89 and 1959Go77                  
206TL c  1962Ko12: measured E(|a) and I(|a) with ionization chamber using       
206TL2c  E|a({+234}U)=4768 keV as a reference.                                  
