206PB9cG 6.0 {I10} (1977Dr08), respectively. It should be noted that the BRICC  
206PBacG program (2008Ki07) gives ce(K)/tot=|W(E0,K)/|W(E0,t)=0.8554 in very    
206PBbcG good agreement with the experimentally determined value of 0.85 {I6}.  
