206ACac  {I50} (|a{-3}) and the other using 3 triple events                     
206ACbc  (recoil-|a{-1}-|a{-3}) (E|a{-2} missing): 7772 keV {I50} (|a{-1}) and  
206ACxc  6760 keV (|a{-3}).                                                     
